message: "If you use these data or code, please cite the manuscript and this repository."
title: "Data and code for: Reduced frontoparietal-visual connectivity in aphantasia: an audit of the imaging evidence and its citation record"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Bassi
    given-names: Jaiveer
