repository-code: "https://github.com/imjbassi/aphantasia-connectivity-audit"
keywords:
  - aphantasia
  - mental imagery
  - functional connectivity
  - citation analysis
  - statistical power
abstract: >-
  Extraction sheet for 19 neuroimaging studies of aphantasia (sampling, group definition,
  procedural safeguards, data sharing), a connectivity-extraction sheet, the citation-coding
  sheet, and the scripts used to compute power figures, resolve references and check extracted
  values against source texts. Each row is tagged with the depth of verification: full text,
  preprint, abstract only, or not retrieved. No new empirical data were collected.
